## Project Structure

```
VOLTBRIDGE/
│
├── backend/
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── index.js                  ← Express server entry point
│   │   ├── routes/
│   │   │   ├── energy.js             ← GET /api/energy/live, /history
│   │   │   ├── savings.js            ← GET /api/savings
│   │   │   └── auth.js               ← POST /api/auth/login
│   │   ├── services/
│   │   │   ├── mock.js               ← Simulated data (MVP phase)
│   │   │   ├── homeassistant.js      ← Real HA REST API (future)
│   │   │   └── inverter.js           ← Fronius/SMA parsers (future)
│   │   └── db/
│   │       └── index.js              ← PostgreSQL connection (future)
│   ├── .env                          ← Environment variables (not in git)
│   └── package.json
│
└── frontend/
    ├── index.html                    ← Vite HTML entry point
    ├── vite.config.js                ← Vite + React plugin config
    ├── src/
    │   ├── main.jsx                  ← React app bootstrap
    │   ├── App.jsx                   ← Routes definition
    │   ├── index.css                 ← Global styles
    │   ├── api/
    │   │   └── client.js             ← Axios API client
    │   ├── components/
    │   │   ├── PowerFlowCard.jsx     ← Live solar/house/grid/battery
    │   │   ├── SavingsCard.jsx       ← Monthly savings in €
    │   │   ├── EnergyChart.jsx       ← 24h history line chart
    │   │   └── AutomationsList.jsx   ← Active automations overview
    │   └── pages/
    │       ├── Dashboard.jsx         ← Main energy dashboard
    │       ├── Login.jsx             ← Client login page
    │       └── Clients.jsx           ← Multi-tenant client list
    └── package.json
```

