## Getting Started

### Prerequisites
- Node.js 18+ installed
- npm 9+
- Two terminal windows

### 1. Start the backend

```bash
cd VOLTBRIDGE/backend
npm install
npm run dev
```

Server starts at `http://localhost:3001`

Test endpoints:
- `http://localhost:3001/api/health` — server status
- `http://localhost:3001/api/energy/live` — live energy data (mock)
- `http://localhost:3001/api/savings` — monthly savings (mock)

### 2. Start the frontend

```bash
cd VOLTBRIDGE/frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

Dashboard opens at `http://localhost:5173`

### Demo login
- Email: `demo@voltbridge.de`
- Password: `demo123`

