## Environment Variables

Create `backend/.env` (never commit to git):

```env
PORT=3001
HA_URL=http://192.168.1.100:8123
HA_TOKEN=your_home_assistant_long_lived_token
JWT_SECRET=your_secret_key_here
DB_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/voltbridge
```

---

## Why This Project Exists

The smart home and renewable energy market is growing structurally — not as a trend, but because energy costs in Germany and Europe remain permanently high and automation is the only scalable way to reduce them.

Most smart home service providers are either pure electricians (no software) or pure IT developers (no hardware, no on-site work). VoltBridge is built by a hybrid: someone who understands both sides, speaks four languages (German, English, Polish, Russian), and can serve the underserved Eastern European household segment in Germany that currently has no dedicated smart home integrator.

This is not a generic SaaS product. It is infrastructure software for the physical world.

